# What the long-running agents import. Compiled to requirements.txt with
#   uv pip compile ops/requirements.in -o ops/requirements.txt --python-version 3.14
# and installed by ops/install.sh into the agents' own environment (ops/venv.sh).
#
# gtfs-realtime-bindings: the archiver, and the skip set in the server and the
#   notifier. service.skipped_trips imports it inside a try, so without it every
#   skip lookup is swallowed as though cdn.mbta.com were down.
# polars: the server's /today replays the archive; _score_today swallows the
#   ImportError and serves an empty summary forever.
# numpy: the notifier's quantile arithmetic.
gtfs-realtime-bindings
polars
numpy
